# Build context hygiene. Without this, `COPY . .` in docker/Dockerfile drags the
# developer's local node_modules (host-platform binaries + pnpm symlinks) over
# the Linux ones installed in the deps stage, and `prisma generate` dies with
# MODULE_NOT_FOUND. It would also bake .env secrets into an image layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.lighthouseci
dist
out
*.tsbuildinfo
packages/db/generated
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
